---
// About / Why Us Section
---

<section id="about" class="section-padding bg-surface-50">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left: About card -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-900 to-brand-700 rounded-3xl p-10 lg:p-12 text-white shadow-2xl shadow-brand-900/30">
            <div class="absolute top-6 right-6 w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-white/5"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-10 right-16 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-accent-400/10"></div>

            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 relative z-10">Generalsoft</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-200 leading-relaxed mb-8 relative z-10">
              Generalsoft For Education & Training Computer Software is a professionally licensed company operating from mainland Dubai, United Arab Emirates.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-4 relative z-10">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-300" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.05 4.05a7 7 0 119.9 9.9L10 18.9l-4.95-4.95a7 7 0 010-9.9zM10 11a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Location</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-brand-200">Mainland Dubai, UAE</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-300" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4 4a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v12a1 1 0 110 2h-3a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2a1 1 0 00-1-1H9a1 1 0 00-1 1v2a1 1 0 01-1 1H4a1 1 0 110-2V4zm3 1h2v2H7V5zm2 4H7v2h2V9zm2-4h2v2h-2V5zm2 4h-2v2h2V9z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">License</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-brand-200">eTrader Professional License</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-300" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                    <path d="M9 2a1 1 0 000 2h2a1 1 0 100-2H9z" />
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4 5a2 2 0 012-2 3 3 0 003 3h2a3 3 0 003-3 2 2 0 012 2v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V5zm3 4a1 1 0 000 2h.01a1 1 0 100-2H7zm3 0a1 1 0 000 2h3a1 1 0 100-2h-3zm-3 4a1 1 0 100 2h.01a1 1 0 100-2H7zm3 0a1 1 0 100 2h3a1 1 0 100-2h-3z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Activities</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-brand-200">Education & Training Computer Software · Computer Systems & Communication Equipment Software Design</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Why Us -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <span class="section-label">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.267 3.455a3.066 3.066 0 001.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 013.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 001.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 012.812 2.812c.051.643.304 1.254.723 1.745a3.066 3.066 0 010 3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723 1.745 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812 2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-3.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812-2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 010-3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 012.812-2.812zm7.44 5.252a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
          Why Generalsoft
        </span>
        <h2 class="section-title mb-8">
          Built for the
          <span class="gradient-text">UAE market</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <span class="text-accent-700 font-bold">1</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">UAE MOE Framework Expertise</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Our AI courses are purpose-built to align with the national AI education framework — not adapted from foreign curricula.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <span class="text-accent-700 font-bold">2</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Local Presence, Global Standards</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Licensed and operating from mainland Dubai, we combine local market understanding with international software development standards.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <span class="text-accent-700 font-bold">3</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">End-to-End Delivery</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">From systems analysis and software design through installation, testing, and ongoing operation — we handle the entire lifecycle.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <span class="text-accent-700 font-bold">4</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Education + Enterprise</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">We understand both the education sector and business operations — so our software actually works the way schools and companies need it to.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
